Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.85,0:00:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.83,0:00:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.27,0:00:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.57,0:00:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.99,0:01:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The card I hold in my hand\Nis the key to my victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.67,0:01:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I play it, your world will\Ncrumble as you sink to your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.11,0:01:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I can set Joey free from\Nyour control first, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.81,0:01:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Set Joey free?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.57,0:01:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as long as I hold the\NMillennium Rod in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.31,0:01:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Play that card and destroy little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.75,0:01:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe out the rest of his life points and\Nwin me the power I deserve, and do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.61,0:01:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I've been waiting\Nfor is about to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.03,0:01:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.73,0:01:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No There's got to be a way\Nto put a stop to this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll hurt Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.21,0:01:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, isn't there some way we can stop\Nthis without putting Taya in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on you guys time is almost up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stop this duel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.05,0:01:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about me Just save Yugi and Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.27,0:02:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't do something soon,\Nthey'll both be in major trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.21,0:02:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just do it! I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.57,0:02:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't listen to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.51,0:02:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll push that button!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.51,0:02:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let Taya get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.79,0:02:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be a way to\Nstop these rare hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.31,0:02:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me! Now listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.59,0:02:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance to break free!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore that fool, my servant, and use your\Nmeteor of destruction to finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.37,0:02:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as you play that card,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.53,0:02:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,little Yugi will receive 1,000 points\Nworth of damage, destroying him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.17,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And his most prized\Npossessions will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.99,0:02:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He certainly won't need\Nthem where he's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do as I command and deliver\Nthe final strike against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.49,0:02:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to remember who you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.87,0:02:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.01,0:02:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's faint, but I also\Nremember my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember going to Duelist Kingdom and\Ndueling my hardest to get to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.41,0:03:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to keep\Nusing the magic of Elegant
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.47,0:03:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Egotist to double my harpies\Nagain and again each turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Thousand Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.13,0:03:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack with Inferno Flame Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, time to meet Red-Eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A dragon like none you've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.05,0:03:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, time warp, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.33,0:03:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.65,0:03:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My dragon's been fossilized!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did I win you star chips, but\NI won you red eyes too, fair and square!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, bozo brothers, try this on\Nfor size, the Red-Eyes Black Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.89,0:03:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, with the magic\Nof my polymerization card,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll combine Joey's red\Neyes with my Southern Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Skull Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Molten Fireball Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.15,0:04:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall to the dirt like a whimpering dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.31,0:04:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just face it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a loser and a third-rate\Nduelist who belongs on his knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do a thing without\Nyour pal Yugi helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.29,0:04:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up off the floor, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you expect to win the\Nfinals acting like a big baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, chill out. The pommelin'
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,will commence as soon as I'm good and\Nready, so don't get your briefs in a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that, blondie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.31,0:04:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Flash, flare, blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of this duel will\Nwin three million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.09,0:04:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll win you keep it your\Nsister needs that money you please
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,use this money for Serenity's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:05:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Operation. Thanks, Yugi. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.03,0:05:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you win so take my locator card\Nyou're finished weevil yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.65,0:05:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,there goes my best problem What\Nhave you done to my queen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You all right, Mako?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.35,0:05:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that was an excellent duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.13,0:05:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll treat your cards well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.27,0:05:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And best of luck in the finals. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.95,0:05:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all right, Mako.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.57,0:05:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, when you think about it, Yuge,\Nboth of our hearts are in our decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.11,0:05:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, we won't let\Nany duelist beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.55,0:05:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true We'll whoop this Maric creep and\Nhis rare hunter goon squad so hard They
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,won't know what hit him They'll be sorry\Nthat they ever decided to mess with us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My past,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,it's real You have no past\NNow destroy him Destroy Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.95,0:06:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my head Your feeble\Nbrain is no match for me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.03,0:06:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, play Meteor of Destruction\Nnow You belong to me, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.37,0:06:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And I command you to vanquish Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.45,0:06:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't destroy Yu-Gi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi's my pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight him, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Obey me at once or face\Nsevere consequences!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.25,0:06:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.55,0:06:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta be strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's gonna do it! I know he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.39,0:06:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Our friendship is strong\Nand so is his will!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.97,0:06:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's Millennium\NRod's got nothing on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.63,0:06:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just got to keep fighting and break
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.95,0:06:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,free before that anchor\Nfalls into the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,taking us with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.43,0:06:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We can beat Merrick in his own\Ntwisted game as soon as you wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You hide like a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But wherever you are, I know you can\Nhear me, and I've got some news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:07:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be a loser in this duel,\Nbut it's not who you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.41,0:07:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not me, and it's not Joey either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You will lose this duel! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have thought you could force Joey\Nto destroy me by taking over his mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but it looks like there's\Nsomething you didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.13,0:07:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,take into account when you made your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.55,0:07:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The strength of Joey's\Nbond with his friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Time may be running out, but Joey's back,\Nand we're in control of this duel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power over Joey has been removed,\Nand I'd say that means you lose, Yuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That timer may run out,\Nbut since Joey is free,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't be considered\Nthe winner of this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.84,0:07:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're not dueling anymore,\Nhow can you possibly win this duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.85,0:07:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What does Yugi think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That fool! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys. End this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.93,0:08:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do now, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait in your little\Nhideaway till you lose this duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.31,0:08:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance for\Nvictory, so come and get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.35,0:08:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey can't be controlled,\Nso it's up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone can be controlled,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and once I force Joey to play\NMeteor of Destruction, you're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.05,0:08:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't! Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.27,0:08:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can resist my Millennium Rod!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.63,0:08:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the full potential\Nof its ancient powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler no longer exists!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.23,0:08:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.31,0:08:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Meteor of Destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.47,0:08:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare to disrespect my power?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.11,0:08:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your friend is\Nweaker than you thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.13,0:08:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's losing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.73,0:08:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You geese!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:08:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler's will was too\Npowerful to overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.19,0:09:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew Joey's heart was\Ntoo strong for Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.57,0:09:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Trap card, activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mystical ref panel will\Nstop Merrick's meteor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My trap card has absorbed the effects\Nof Merrick's Meteor of Destruction card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my Mystical Ref Panel can redirect\Nthe Meteor's attack wherever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.21,0:09:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to put you in danger, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.09,0:09:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.03,0:09:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi has quite a predicament on his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Mystical Ref Panel, he has the\Npower to control the outcome of this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving him with a difficult decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.21,0:10:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He can either direct the attack towards\NWheeler or choose to destroy himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And if either of them try to\Nescape, then Tay is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless my plan works soon,\Nbut time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.45,0:10:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I wearing your Millennium Puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.23,0:10:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I gave it to you, Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,when I was trying to help\Nyou remember our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.07,0:10:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.49,0:10:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick tried to turn you against me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.63,0:10:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but our friendship ended up\Nbeing stronger than his powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And giving you my puzzle\Nhelped you to break free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.59,0:10:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my best friend, Joey, and\Nno evil magic can take that away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.69,0:10:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I have to put an end to this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But remember, we defeated\NMerrick together, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.93,0:10:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys better do something\Nsoon, or... Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.03,0:10:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you're both in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.79,0:10:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.87,0:10:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:10:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of Kaiba's choppers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.99,0:11:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But who's flying that thing? No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's remote control.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.49,0:11:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you, time to drop the crate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I stop you first, Rare Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to my blue-eyes\Nwhite dragon card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.43,0:11:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper's taking out the trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya's safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.27,0:11:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! I'll get you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.69,0:11:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.53,0:11:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we're even now, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's help Yugi and Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.91,0:11:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.05,0:11:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.93,0:11:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If one of us doesn't win,\Nwe'll both be pulled under.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:12:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no way I'm going\Nto let that happen, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.55,0:12:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Yook?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.37,0:12:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that I've\Ndecided to save you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in both of us going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I lose, you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't let you do this, Yook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So now... No, Yooki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.95,0:12:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of my puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.19,0:12:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ref panel, direct your attack toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.95,0:12:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.11,0:12:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The key.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't just save myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta help Yugi, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, free yourself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.27,0:12:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You've only got 30 seconds to make it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the anchor falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to unlock your chains now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, before the anchor\Nfalls and pulls you under.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No way am I letting my best\Nfriend become shark bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.51,0:13:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in this together, you, and there's\Nno way I'm letting you take the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna make it out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't give up, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.35,0:13:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.33,0:13:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteor of Destruction has another effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.15,0:13:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Yugi has a monster on the\Nfield, I can force it to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.35,0:13:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel isn't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-Eyes Black Dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe out my life points, so\NYugi's key will be revealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Good old red-eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you've saved my butt\Nmore times than I can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.47,0:14:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, Joey's gonna be\Nthe one doing the rescuing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You taught me about courage\Nand never giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.15,0:14:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be out of those chains in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.37,0:14:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta beat the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That anchor's going to\Ndrag both of them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.37,0:14:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.79,0:14:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! Yugi! Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.45,0:15:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.69,0:15:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I wouldn't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.63,0:15:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best friend\Na guy could ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.47,0:15:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.89,0:15:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha, let's go! Where's Joey? His key!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.33,0:15:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey never took it from the box!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.37,0:15:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and go get me his key!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll dive down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.45,0:15:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, this key won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.97,0:15:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I need the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.35,0:15:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it Yugi coming back\Ndown here to get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:15:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,She did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.81,0:16:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.21,0:16:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan and Mai brought me here\Nafter we tracked you guys down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.23,0:16:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey! Hey, Yugi! What's up? How cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The geeks are back together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.91,0:16:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've set things straight\Nby saving Mokuba's little friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.35,0:16:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can get back to Battle City and\Nprepare for my victory in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I'm, uh, well, uh,\NI'm sorry, man. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But I almost destroyed our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but in the end, not only did\Nyou save our friendship, you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.35,0:16:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I realized what I was doing to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.31,0:16:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to make it right or\Nthrew myself in trying, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:17:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since we've been friends, we've\Nalways kept an eye out for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.59,0:17:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't going to let some\Nrare hunter creep change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.33,0:17:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,even if my brain was turned to mush.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.57,0:17:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But that Marek made a complete fool out of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.19,0:17:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? How can I show my\Nface at the finals now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.81,0:17:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you get a grip please\NYou showed some real
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.79,0:17:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,courage out there Joey So\Nwho cares about how you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,looked Just like the courage\Nyou showed at Duelist
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kingdom When you dueled\Nfor your sister Remember
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.33,0:17:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,that What she did today\Nshe did because of you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.85,0:17:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're her idol. Ding dong.\NWhat kind of idol gets
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.07,0:17:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,turned into a zombie\NAnd then almost destroys
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,his best friend Talk about\Nsetting a bad example.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.49,0:17:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop feeling sorry for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.61,0:17:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister gets her strength from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she waited till\Nnow to take her bandages off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.75,0:17:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, you can see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.57,0:17:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid at first, but\Nhearing you save Yugi inspired me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,After I took my bandages\Noff and opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,you showed me what courage\Nwas all about, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had to dive in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it through my\Noperation because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always been there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.69,0:18:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Today it was my turn to be\Nthere for you, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.57,0:18:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I'd say we're a pretty good team.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we're all together, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.95,0:18:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.77,0:18:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure glad that's over. Ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.39,0:18:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi, I believe this is\Nyours. Thanks for everything, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey I gotta be the luckiest\Nguy in the world to have
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,friends like this Even when\Nthings seemed hopeless,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,they never gave up on me\NIf it weren't for them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,who knows where I'd be
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi, I'm glad that Millennium\NPuzzle is back where it belongs
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:18:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.41,0:19:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe a big thanks to you too,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yami You trusted me enough to\Nlet me handle this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.61,0:19:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never have broken through\Nto Joey if you didn't believe in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I make a great team,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.11,0:19:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's also nice to know that I have\Nthe strength to hold my own if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.11,0:19:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And you helped me find that\Nstrength inside myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.27,0:19:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, anyone hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.59,0:19:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.67,0:19:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.21,0:19:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaiba! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.63,0:19:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have gotten out\Nof that mess without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I did what I had to, Yugi. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.51,0:19:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you at the Battle City Finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that means you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,In all this insanity, I\Nforgot about the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.91,0:19:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That could be where\NMerrick will strike next.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.11,0:19:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This fight is far from over, and whenever\NMerrick comes back, I'll be ready for him.
